  "description": "Full-suss, full fun\nWe’ve applied all the innovation and attention to detail that make our adult T-140 bikes exceptional trail performers and crafted them into this junior, trail-blasting full-suspension mountain bike. From singletrack to bike parks, the versatile T-140 27 is ready to ride anywhere.\n\nHighlights\n– 140mm front and 135mm of rear suspension travel.\n– 6061 aluminium SCR framset with ISCG 2 guide mounts + geometry adjustment + Boost dropouts.\n– RockShox Pike 27.5in fork + RockShox Deluxe Select+ RT shock.\n– Shimano Deore 1x11 transmission (32T chainring x 11-51T cassette).\n– KS 900I dropper seatpost + bar-mounted remote with size-specific drop.\n– 27.5in WTB ST i30 rims + Maxxis tyres front and rear.\n– TRP Slate Evo four-piston hydraulic disc brakes (180mm rotors)",
